# Secrets — never commit. .env holds your OpenRouter API key, database password
# and dashboard secret. If you have already pushed it once, change those values.
.env

# Databases and generated data
*.db
logs/*.jsonl
# Results from real people contain what they typed; keep them private.
# (results_demo.md is practice data and is fine to share.)
analysis/results_live.md

# Menu PDF: contains 32 dish photos of unconfirmed origin, and the app doesn't
